0190+  2892             ;**************************************************
0191+  2892             ;* Init data in the following order:        
0192+  2892             ;*                                          
0193+  2892             ;*  Reactor     XL,XH,YL,YH                 
0194+  2892             ;*  Fireballs   XL,XH,YL,YH,VELXH,VELYH   
0195+  2892             ;*  Perkoids    XL,XH,YL,YH,VELXH,VELYH  
0196+  2892             ;*  Max         XL,XH,YL,YH,MAXDATA(XXSSDDDD)
0197+  2892             ;*                Where:
0198+  2892             ;*                     SS = Speed (00=Slowest,01=Slow,02=Normal,03=Agressive)
0199+  2892             ;*                   DDDD = Distance in Stamps before Max 'activates' and starts moving
0200+  2892             ;*
0201+  2892             ;*  #FE signals start of Perkoid data, used again, it signals start of Max data  
0202+  2892             ;*  #FF signals end of all data           
